    "title": "Delaware women's tennis adjusts opening weekend matches due to weather",
    "text": "The University of Delaware women’s tennis team has made adjustments to its opening weekend schedule due to expected weather issues in the mid-Atlantic region.\nThe team will now begin its season against Bellarmine on Thursday, January 22 at 12:30 p.m. This match was previously set for January 24. In addition, the Fightin’ Blue Hens will play their first Conference USA match against Liberty on Friday, January 23 at 1 p.m., which is one hour earlier than originally planned.\n“FOLLOW ON SOCIAL For the latest on Delaware women’s tennis, follow the Blue Hens on X, formerly known as Twitter and Instagram.”",
